      "id": "claim_0162e98187c4487aa97bd925f9ffe05f",
      "statement": "POST /api/reservations enforces three request body guards: http.MaxBytesReader limits the body to 65536 bytes, the JSON decoder disallows unknown fields, and a second decoder check expects io.EOF to ensure the body contains exactly one JSON object.",
