      "id": "claim_195d1f3535ee42efbc3f7a32cbcf381c",
      "statement": "POST /api/reservations accepts a ReserveRequest with orderId (string) and items (array of Item), validates that orderId is 1-100 characters, items count is 1-100, SKUs are distinct and 1-100 characters, and quantities are 1-1000, then returns a 200 Reservation JSON with authoritative ReservedItem prices, computed subtotalCents, and status reserved.",
